    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86837" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρό-βλητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thrown forth</i> or
				<i>away,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυσὶν π.</span>
			<i>cast</i> to the dogs, <i><span class="en">
