				<u>Aj.</u>
				830
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spread, beaten out</i> into plates, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργύριον</span> prob.l.in <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Je.</u>
				10.5(9)
			</span></i>.</div>
